  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Pes 301.01 “Certificate of registration” means permission granted by the board to a person engaged in the commercial application of pesticides or in the private application of restricted pesticides.\n\nSource. #741, eff 1-18-76; amd by #1756, eff 5-26-81; ss by #2209, eff 12-13-82; ss by #2781, eff 7-26-84; ss by #4867, eff 7-19-90; amd by #5393, eff 5-12-92; ss by #6258, eff 5-30-96; ss by #8059, eff 5-30-04; ss by #10198-B, eff 10-3-12; ss by #13363, eff 6-1-22, EXPIRES: 6-1-32",
